{"ordinal":14606,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452392296452","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Death_00a36fd","source":"Fatman: Чем тут…","target":"Fatman: Cu ce… aici…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-370.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14607,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452392296451","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Death_0a9ca23","source":"Fatman: В аду не хуже…","target":"Fatman: Nici în iad nu-i mai rău…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-370.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14608,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452392296450","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Ears_DontShoot_021fa41","source":"Fatman: Иногда… хочется просто тишины. Но её не бывает. Даже когда никто не говорит… всё равно в голове шум.","target":"Fatman: Uneori… aș vrea doar liniște. Dar nu există. Chiar și când nu vorbește nimeni… tot e zgomot în cap.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-370.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14609,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452392296449","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Photo_DontShoot_0e1e5ba","source":"Fatman: Всё равно остаётся… отпечаток. Люди хорошо помнят тех, кто влияет на их судьбу. Вот такие дела.","target":"Fatman: Tot rămâne… o urmă. Oamenii îi țin bine minte pe cei care le schimbă soarta. Asta e.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-370.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14610,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452392296448","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Photo_DontShoot_01a46e6","source":"Fatman: Фотографии сжигали, бумаги подчищали, даже покушение однажды было! А толку?","target":"Fatman: Au ars fotografiile, au șters actele, ba chiar au încercat odată să mă ucidă! Și la ce bun?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-370.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14611,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452388102154","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Photo_DontShoot_0f25538","source":"Fatman: Знаешь… Пару раз меня уже пытались «стереть».","target":"Fatman: Știi… Au încercat deja de câteva ori să mă „șteargă”.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-370.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14612,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452388102153","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Armpit_DontShoot_05569b0","source":"Fatman: А потом его загнали в угол. И никакая «грива» не спасла.","target":"Fatman: Iar apoi l-au încolțit. Și nicio „coamă” nu l-a salvat.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-370.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14613,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452388102152","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Armpit_DontShoot_07bda6b","source":"Fatman: В молодости я знал одного человека… Тоже, кхе-хе, с таким же «богатством» под руками. Он говорил: «Это как волосы на голове Самсона».","target":"Fatman: În tinerețe am cunoscut un om… Avea și el, he-he, o asemenea „bogăție” sub brațe. Spunea: „E ca părul de pe capul lui Samson.”","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-370.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14614,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452388102151","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Armpit_DontShoot_031d266","source":"Fatman: Вот такая херня и приключается.","target":"Fatman: Uite ce căcaturi se mai întâmplă.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-370.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14615,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452388102150","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Armpit_DontShoot_0a759ae","source":"Fatman: Ты бы знал, сколько мне приходилось потеть! А до врачей дойти времени просто нет.","target":"Fatman: De-ai ști cât am fost nevoit să transpir! Iar timp de mers la doctor n-am deloc.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-370.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14616,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452388102149","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Eyes_DontShoot_0de1568","source":"Fatman: Раньше глаза у меня были зелёные. Чистые такие, прозрачные. Теперь вот… мутные. Жизнь набросала пыли, да никто не протёр.","target":"Fatman: Înainte aveam ochii verzi. Limpezi, transparenți. Acum… sunt tulburi. Viața a aruncat praf peste ei și nimeni nu l-a șters.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-370.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14617,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452388102148","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Eyes_DontShoot_0458db1","source":"Fatman: Напридумывают тут – в глаза смотреть, а потом пушкой тыкать. Ишь чего вздумали, дэбилы!!!","target":"Fatman: Ce le mai trece prin cap: să te privească în ochi, apoi să-ți bage pușca în față. Ia te uită ce-au scornit idioții!!!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-370.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14618,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452388102147","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Hands_DontShoot_06ea8da","source":"Fatman: Было время, когда я мог одной подписью решить чужую судьбу. Теперь вот смотрю… и думаю: лучше б кто-то расписался на моей.","target":"Fatman: A fost o vreme când puteam hotărî soarta altuia cu o singură semnătură. Acum mă uit la mine… și mă gândesc că mai bine semna cineva pentru soarta mea.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-370.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14619,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452388102146","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Teeth_DontShoot_00cb345","source":"Fatman: Теперь вот смотрю в зеркало и понимаю… кажись, этот нервяк не стоил того.","target":"Fatman: Acum mă uit în oglindă și-mi dau seama… parcă stresul ăsta n-a meritat.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-370.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14620,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452388102145","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Teeth_DontShoot_008f8e4","source":"Fatman: Когда-то мне стоматолог говорил: бросай, а то зубы посыпятся. А я ему: «Ты, сука, вообще понимаешь, с чем я дело имею?!»","target":"Fatman: Cândva, dentistul mi-a zis să mă las de fumat, că altfel o să-mi cadă dinții. Iar eu i-am zis: „Bă, futu-i, tu pricepi măcar cu ce am de-a face?!”","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-370.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14621,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452388102144","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Ears_Gun_0c9ba68","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14622,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452383907850","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Ears_Gun_085d510","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14623,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452383907849","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Ears_Gun_0cd3213","source":"Fatman: Шутишь, что ли, дружок?","target":"Fatman: Glumești, prietene?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-370.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14624,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452383907848","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Photo_Gun_03d4029","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14625,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452383907847","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Photo_Gun_006fa29","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14626,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452383907846","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Photo_Gun_0ff2b49","source":"Fatman: Если эта фотка – мой приговор, давай заканчивать. Знаю, сам таким  был. Вершил судьбы. Не тяни уже.","target":"Fatman: Dacă fotografia asta e sentința mea, hai să terminăm. Știu, și eu eram așa. Hotăram destine. Nu mai trage de timp.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-370.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14627,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452383907845","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Armpit_Gun_09780ed","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14628,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452383907844","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Armpit_Gun_05107be","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14629,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452383907843","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Armpit_Gun_0ce42ce","source":"Fatman: Стреляй, если думаешь, что так что-то изменится.","target":"Fatman: Trage, dacă crezi că așa o să se schimbe ceva.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-370.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14630,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452383907842","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Armpit_Gun_0754963","source":"Fatman: Ну подумаешь, с подмышками проблемы! Кто в наше время без херни какой-то?","target":"Fatman: Și ce dacă am probleme la subraț? Cine n-are câte o belea în vremurile astea?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-370.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14631,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452383907841","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Eyes_Gun_077cbde","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14632,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452383907840","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Eyes_Gun_00dd704","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14633,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452379713545","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Eyes_Gun_0e23127","source":"Fatman: Ну, давай, приятель, мне уже всё равно, чем этот цирк закончится.","target":"Fatman: Hai, prietene, nu-mi mai pasă cum se termină circul ăsta.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-370.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14634,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452379713544","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Hands_Gun_00711bb","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14635,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452379713543","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Hands_Gun_0af2456","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14636,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452379713542","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Hands_Gun_0a07b98","source":"Fatman: Если судить по рукам, я уже давно труп. Так что давай… финальный штрих с тебя.","target":"Fatman: Dacă judeci după mâini, sunt mort de mult. Așa că hai… tu pui ultima tușă.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-370.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14637,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452379713541","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Hands_Gun_0c464d4","source":"Fatman: Чё это, преступление, что ль, в твоём доме?","target":"Fatman: Ce, asta e o infracțiune la tine-n casă?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-370.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14638,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452379713540","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Hands_Gun_0d1abe8","source":"Fatman: От нервяка этого всего я сигареты-то постоянно кромсаю. Прям пальцами. Уже надоело грязь из-под ногтей вычищать – вот и решил оставить так.","target":"Fatman: De la toți nervii ăștia îmi tot fărâmițez țigările. Chiar cu degetele. M-am săturat să tot scot murdăria de sub unghii, așa că am lăsat-o acolo.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-370.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14639,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452379713539","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Teeth_Gun_0128eaf","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14640,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452379713538","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Teeth_Gun_0a8a212","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14641,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452379713537","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Teeth_Gun_0672255","source":"Fatman: Да стреляй уже, приятель. Посмотрим, как тебе после этого житься будет.","target":"Fatman: Hai, trage odată, prietene. Să vedem cum o să mai trăiești după aceea.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-370.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14642,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452379713536","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Ears_06b754c","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14643,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452375519242","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Ears_0f57aaf","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14644,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452375519241","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Ears_027c6e7","source":"Fatman: Вот они, уши министра. Всякое слышали. И крики, и шёпот…","target":"Fatman: Uite-le, urechile unui ministru. Au auzit de toate. Și țipete, și șoapte…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-371.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14645,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452375519240","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Ears_00c6c80","source":"Fatman: ...","target":"Fatman: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-371.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14646,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452375519239","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Ears_0bea36b","source":"Fatman: Ой, да чего там смотреть…","target":"Fatman: Of, ce să mai vezi acolo…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-371.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14647,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452375519238","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Photo_05d7688","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14648,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452375519237","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Photo_0a3fbe1","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14649,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452375519236","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Photo_0aab029","source":"Fatman: Ну? Я как? Всё такой же, да?","target":"Fatman: Ei? Cum arăt? Tot la fel, nu?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-371.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14650,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452375519235","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Photo_09b1238","source":"Fatman: ...","target":"Fatman: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-371.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14651,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452375519234","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Photo_0c390c6","source":"Fatman: Давай. Сейчас, встану только… как в старые добрые…","target":"Fatman: Hai. Numai să mă ridic… ca pe vremuri…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-371.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14652,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452375519233","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Armpit_0dc017d","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14653,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452375519232","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Armpit_0926d54","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14654,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452371324938","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Armpit_08f6bda","source":"Fatman: Эээх, бляяяять…","target":"Fatman: Eeeh, fuuutu-i…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-371.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14655,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452371324937","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Armpit_0766c23","source":"Fatman: Ну, значит, сил у меня было на троих. Только где она была, эта сила, когда надо было?..","target":"Fatman: Înseamnă că aveam putere cât pentru trei. Numai că unde era puterea asta când trebuia?..","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-371.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14656,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452371324936","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Armpit_06b69f2","source":"Fatman: Ха. А знаешь, мне когда-то сказали, что волосы тут — это символ силы. Кх-хе-хе-хе…","target":"Fatman: Ha. Știi, cândva mi s-a spus că părul de aici e simbolul puterii. He-he-he-he…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-371.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14657,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452371324935","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Armpit_086bd1f","source":"Fatman: Ты только не ссы. Я жить буду.","target":"Fatman: Nu te căca pe tine. O să trăiesc.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-371.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14658,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452371324934","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Armpit_076f871","source":"Fatman: ...","target":"Fatman: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-371.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14659,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452371324933","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Armpit_0eff35b","source":"Fatman: Эх, ну и проверки у тебя, приятель.","target":"Fatman: Eh, ce verificări mai faci, prietene.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-371.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14660,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452371324932","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Eyes_0b0adba","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
