{"ordinal":14662,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452371324930","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Eyes_009cfe1","source":"Fatman: Ай, да похер. Ну что, доволен?","target":"Fatman: Ah, mi se rupe. Ei, ești mulțumit?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-371.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14663,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452371324929","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Eyes_0389579","source":"Fatman: Ну, чё видишь? Думал, я пьяница? Да хрен там. Просто жизнь такая, что без сп…","target":"Fatman: Ei, ce vezi? Credeai că-s bețiv? Nici vorbă. Doar că viața e așa, încât fără al…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-371.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
