{"ordinal":14668,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452367130632","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Hands_023262c","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14669,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452367130631","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Hands_0136b63","source":"Fatman: Держат только себя. И то не всегда.","target":"Fatman: Acum nu se mai țin decât pe ele. Și nici asta mereu.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-371.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14670,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452367130630","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Hands_0521516","source":"Fatman: Вот… Великая реликвия прошлого. Руки, которые держали рюмку, сигару и, кхе-хе, целую страну. Теперь уж…","target":"Fatman: Uite… Marea relicvă a trecutului. Mâinile care au ținut un pahar de tărie, un trabuc și, he-he, o țară întreagă. Acum însă…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-371.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14671,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452367130629","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Hands_022152d","source":"Fatman: ...","target":"Fatman: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-371.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
