{"ordinal":14673,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452367130627","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Teeth_065934a","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14674,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452367130626","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Teeth_07f70c9","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14675,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452367130625","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Teeth_085e19b","source":"Fatman: Кто-то сдаётся после первой затяжки, а я… я всю жизнь только и тянул.","target":"Fatman: Unii se lasă după primul fum, iar eu… eu am tras toată viața.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-371.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14676,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452367130624","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Teeth_0c4f70f","source":"Fatman: Ну чё, приятно? Пф-ф… Я скажу тебе так, приятель… табак – он не только нервы успокаивает, но и характер проверяет.","target":"Fatman: Ei, e plăcut? Pff… Eu îți spun așa, prietene… tutunul nu doar liniștește nervii, ci îți și pune caracterul la încercare.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-371.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14677,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452362936329","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fatman_Teeth_084de36","source":"Fatman: ...","target":"Fatman: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-371.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
